{"4410310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Exul: Beyond the Gate", "steam_appid": 4410310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Exul: Beyond the Gate&quot; </i>is a top-down space action RPG where you and up to 3 of your friends can pilot a spaceship through the unknown. Explore abandoned space stations, gather resources for your crew's survival, engage in intense ship-to-ship combat reminiscent of &quot;The Expanse&quot;, board your enemies, trade with your allies, and have fun doing it all with your friends or AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the not-so-distant future, humanity has reached for the stars and colonised other planets, moons, and asteroids. Everything was going well and everyone prospered — until a new alien race discovered us. They were far more advanced than we were and took no liking to our expansion. This eventually led to an all-out war!</i><br><i></i><br><i>You are a group of people trying to escape the Milky Way galaxy before the aliens reach Earth and the human race falls. To escape the galaxy, the last remnants of humanity came together to build a jump gate. Where it leads is unknown, but it is surely far enough from here.</i><strong> </strong><i>Be the one to discover what lies</i><strong> Beyond the Gate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/extras/8bd6af951425859cd8814867388a946d.avif?t=1779442128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/extras_big/8bd6af951425859cd8814867388a946d.webp?t=1779442128 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Exul: Beyond the Gate&quot; </i>is a top-down space action RPG where you and up to 3 of your friends can pilot a spaceship through the unknown. Explore abandoned space stations, gather resources for your crew's survival, engage in intense ship-to-ship combat reminiscent of &quot;The Expanse&quot;, board your enemies, trade with your allies, and have fun doing it all with your friends or AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the not-so-distant future, humanity has reached for the stars and colonised other planets, moons, and asteroids. Everything was going well and everyone prospered — until a new alien race discovered us. They were far more advanced than we were and took no liking to our expansion. This eventually led to an all-out war!</i><br><i></i><br><i>You are a group of people trying to escape the Milky Way galaxy before the aliens reach Earth and the human race falls. To escape the galaxy, the last remnants of humanity came together to build a jump gate. Where it leads is unknown, but it is surely far enough from here.</i><strong> </strong><i>Be the one to discover what lies</i><strong> Beyond the Gate!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/extras/8bd6af951425859cd8814867388a946d.avif?t=1779442128\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/extras_big/8bd6af951425859cd8814867388a946d.webp?t=1779442128 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Exul: Beyond the Gate is a top-down retro-sci-fi action RPG shooter where you play as an Exul on his journey to an unknown galaxy. Play with your friends in a Co-Op experience where you loot, shoot, pilot, explore, trade, and much more — all to stay alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/5a732446f1d66bb5e0321b51b5c5613b04eac4bb/header.jpg?t=1779442128", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/bafb001dd7ffc6e0b351b950391699e12f14e396/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779442128", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4410310/bafb001dd7ffc6e0b351b950391699e12f14e396/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779442128", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-12100F / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1660 / AMD RX 590<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> YES</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jaroslav Krninsky"], "publishers": ["Jaroslav Krninsky"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 82, "description": "#category_contrast_controls"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 78, "description": "Adjustable Difficulty"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25"